        <mxCell id="CCm-2qAUIBp0VJCvSnKO-110" value="즉 구조는 이렇게 됨.&#xa;GameplayEventTriggeredAbilities&#xa;{&#xa;    Event.Hit -&gt; [AbilitySpecHandle_A, AbilitySpecHandle_B]&#xa;}&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;OwnedTagTriggeredAbilities&#xa;{&#xa;    State.Stunned -&gt; [AbilitySpecHandle_C]&#xa;}" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1">
